{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.poster.avif?t=1765419274\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.webm?t=1765419274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.mp4?t=1765419274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this darkly comedic horror RPG, that is charmingly similar to a bad and cheesy  horror film youd watch on Halloween night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You were named something unforgivable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stole the Necronomicon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You time-traveled to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You bought the fattest gat on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now? Revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cultist, shoggoth, and elder god pays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring goofy and hilarious full fledged cutscenes one for each of the 5 bosses.<br>Which you can rewatch anytime at the theater that neighbors the main gas station &quot;town&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when you unlock them.<br><br>Diablo-Like equipment menus, Diablo Like Drop System, and DIablo like Skill Trees.<br>If you like Diablo, you'll like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912580?t=1765419274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912580?t=1765419274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39